* [ ] Implement QUICK reconstruction
* [ ] Implement MUSCL reconstruction
* [ ] Add bounded/TVD reconstruction
* [ ] Add flux limiter framework

Architecture:

```text
Cell values
    ↓
Gradient / Reconstruction
    ↓
Face value / reconstruction stencil
    ↓
Convection discretization
    ↓
Matrix contributions
    ↓
Linear system
```

Design goals:

* Reconstruction schemes should not know how equation coefficients are assembled
* Convection schemes should consume reconstructed face values or reconstruction stencils
* Gradient-based and non-gradient-based reconstruction should share a common interface
* Boundary-face behavior should be explicit and consistently handled
* Reconstruction should support both direct face-value evaluation and stencil-based evaluation where applicable

Optimization notes:

* Avoid recomputing interpolation coefficients for static meshes
* Consider caching geometric reconstruction coefficients
* Keep reconstruction operations lightweight enough for face-loop execution
* Avoid virtual dispatch in extremely hot loops if profiling demonstrates measurable overhead
* Preserve a clean polymorphic interface until profiling demonstrates that dispatch is a bottleneck
* Design reconstruction data structures so they can eventually support SIMD/OpenMP/GPU execution

