Optimization strategy:

1. Establish correctness first
2. Build representative verification/benchmark cases
3. Profile before changing performance-critical code
4. Identify dominant costs
5. Optimize the dominant kernel
6. Re-run numerical verification
7. Compare performance against the baseline
8. Preserve optimizations only when they provide measurable benefit

